window.products.push({"id":367025,"name":"OneWorld Memorials Bronze Keepsake Urns - Extra Small - Holds Up to 5 Cubic Inches of Ashes - Pearl White Cremation Urn for Ashes - Engraving Sold Sep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31+j+oozqXL._AC_.jpg","description":"The sophisticated and simplistic design of the pearl finish on this bronze-based keepsake heart will always naturally shine in memory of your loved one. Pearls are rare. As are people with whom we build a true and genuine connection that will last a life time. This pearl colored keepsake heart can commemorate and symbolize the rarity of the bond that exited and will always exists between you and your loved one.Keep the memory of a loved one nearby and near your heart every time you see or hold the OneWorld Memorials Extra Small White Pearl Heart Shaped Bronze Keepsake Memorial Urn. Our extra small memorial urn will fit onto the included stand, creating a freestanding display option. Its pearl white paint finish over bronze creates an eye-catching design that’s ideal for delivering a feeling of serenity. Each urn holds cremation ashes equal to about 5 pounds of body weight prior to cremation. An engraving option is sold separately.Brass is a lightweight metal alloy made of 90% copper and 10% zinc. It gives off a bright golden appearance when polished. Oftentimes, brass cremation urns are finished with bronze or pewter to strengthen the brass and to alter the color. The bronze finish has a more reddish hue, whereas the pewter finish gives off a silver hue. Brass is also easy to cast in a mold as it is a malleable material that can be coated in enamel or paint. It is used in multiple capacities for a wide variety of purposes and has a long history as a favored material for everything from cookery to fine art to metal cremation urns. Our brass cremation urns showcase the fine balance this diverse material offers. The beauty and functionality of brass have given it a high standing among metals and alloys, and it is among the most popular choices in our large selection of cremation urns for ashes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31+j+oozqXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneWorld Memorials","source_asin":"B07PX3PMZ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PX3PMZ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PX3PMZ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
