window.products.push({"id":367048,"name":"Large Mermaid, Decorative Sea Life Wall Hanging Art, Nautical Theme Sculptures, Home Decor, Handmade in Haiti Form Recycled Steel Barrels 7 x 32 Inche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AHY7H-P0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The cleverness of this design is rich. Notice how the mermaid's hair appears as coral branches, pinned with sea stars and fishes swimming through. Her tale is curled forward and up - a very \"flippant\" posture indeed! Brought to you through our artist's skill and hard work and our fair trading practices. Natural color variations from dark silver to rustic brown tones. Handmade in Haiti from recycled oil drum barrels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AHY7H-P0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"it's cactus - metal art haiti","source_asin":"B00O1AD93K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O1AD93K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O1AD93K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":367049,"name":"BrilliStar Blue Hand Towels Blue and Grey Abstract Art Painting Towel Set of 2 Small Bath Towels Soft Guest Face Towel Bathroom Decorations Thin Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BHamQP6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Hand Towels Are The Needs Of Daily Life. Our Towels Meet The Requirements Of You And Your Family In Daily Life. Various Theme Of Patterns Can Add Unique Colors To Your Life. Features: Customized single-sided printed towel set of 2, lightweight, breathable, sweat-absorbent and refreshing. No velvet, soft and skin-friendly, easy to carry.Towels dimensions:13.7\"x29.5\" (35 x 75cm), 2 pack large hand towels per set.Made using extra-soft and impressively absorbent microfiber.Single-side printing. Image printed on microfiber side/terry cloth side blank. Fluffy softness and quick absorbency. Soft enough to be non-irritating but firm enough for proper exfoliation. Good as face towel, hand towel, sweatband, baby towel, kitchen cloth.Perfect gifts: This minimalism style decorative towel add a modern look to bathroom, guest room, kitchen, office. Perfect gift for parents, friends, lovers on birthday, Valentine's Day, st. Patrick's Day, Mother's Day, Memorial Day, Thanksgiving, Independence Day, Easter, housewarming gifts.Washing care: Machine bath washes the bath towels set in warm water using mild detergent and tumble dry on low; recommended to dry immediately, do not use bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BHamQP6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BrilliStar","source_asin":"B09XBF87R2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XBF87R2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XBF87R2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":367050,"name":"Badash Azure Murano-Style Art Glass Vase - 7.5\" Tall Mouth-Blown Glass Bud Vase - Contemporary Home Decor Accent Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QiTlqUZ6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Brighten any spot of your home with a gorgeous Murano-style art glass bud vase placed where everyone can see and enjoy it. The beautifully handcrafted flower vase boasts several layers of vibrant colors that seem to dance inside the glass piece. Its thick and heavy mouth-blown glass design gives it a rich look and feel that adds glamorous style to any room. This vase is a work of art displayed by itself as an accent piece or with a few of your favorite flowers for added elegance. The Azure Murano-style art glass vase measures 7.5\" tall and is hand wash only; each handmade piece may vary slightly in color and design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QiTlqUZ6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Badash","source_asin":"B0C47FKFCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C47FKFCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C47FKFCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
