window.products.push({"id":367052,"name":"Magnetic Cheat Sheet for Instant Pot, Pressure Cooker Magnet, Instapot Accessories Cooking Times Quick Reference Guide Magnets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eoPMLUmHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You want to make a good dinner, but you misremember the cooking time of the ingredients. Or you can only look at the data while preparing the ingredients, and scramble to turn the kitchen into a battlefield.  With this magnetic paste, you can prepare a good dinner with ease and happiness. you don't need to search for the suitable cooking time on smartphone or books. The Insanely Handy Cheat Sheet Magnets that Make Cooking with Your Cooking Pot EVEN Easier! * This 2-pack instant pot decals includes the cooking times, water ratios and air fryer functions of the most commonly cooked foods. * The large magnet is designed to adhere to your fridge or range hood and contains 98 of the most popular foods, including meats, seafood, vegetables, grains, pasta, and legumes. * The small magnet will fit on the side of your Instant Pot or pressure cooker for a super quick reference and contains 14 of the most commonly cooked foods. Spending more time enjoying delicious food with your loved ones, instead of spending hours in the kitchen!! These Insta Pot decals include the following features: * Set of 2 magnetic cheat sheets * Cooking times, water ratios & Insta Pot functions of the most common foods * Small magnet fits on all 3, 6 and 8 quart models * Large magnet fits on your fridge or range hood * Can also be used as a guide for your pressure cooker","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eoPMLUmHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lalafancy","source_asin":"B07QFVHYC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QFVHYC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QFVHYC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
