window.products.push({"id":367079,"name":"MARATHON Slim Jumbo Atomic Wall Clock, Walnut Finish - Large, 15-Inch Display - Alarm, AM/PM or 24-Hour Time, Eight Time Zones, Indoor Temperature & H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BhvjovU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SELF-SETTING, SELF-ADJUSTING CLOCK - Simply insert the batteries provided & the Marathon Slim Jumbo Atomic Wall Clock will synchronize to the correct time using radio frequencies from NIST’s Colorado Atomic Clock (only functions in N. America). LARGE DISPLAY - Our easy-to-read, 15-inch display and the sleek, contemporary design make this beautiful clock ideal for your home, office, school, or church. Easily hang it on the wall or place it on a table using the sturdy, fold-out stand. MULTIPLE MODES - Choose from three different displays: AM/PM or 24-hour format; the month, weekday, and date; or the indoor temperature in Celsius or Fahrenheit, plus humidity. Language can be displayed in English, French, or Spanish. ALARM WITH SNOOZE - The Slim Jumbo Atomic Wall Clock includes an easy-to-set alarm with a convenient snooze function, which runs in five-minute intervals. EIGHT TIME ZONES - This clock includes all eight North American time zones—a worldwide exclusive Marathon clock feature! Choose from Pacific, Mountain, Central, Eastern, Atlantic, Newfoundland, Alaska, and Hawaii standard time. MARATHON - A family company that has been producing timing instruments for over 80 years. Our uncompromising quest for technical excellence allows us to produce the most advanced clock systems with the experience that our long tradition offers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BhvjovU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARATHON","source_asin":"B07THLX4GB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07THLX4GB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07THLX4GB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":367080,"name":"New Classic Furniture Emma Velvet Three Seater Chesterfield Style Sofa for Small Spaces, Deep Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HiU09IZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Emma is a today’s version of a classic Chesterfield Sofa style, characterized by rolled arms the same height as the back, deep button tufting and nailhead trim. Historically popular in English gentlemen’s clubs, the Emma has made its way to the modern day with fresher fabrics and trimmer styling. Many Chesterfield designs are simply too big and bulky to navigate narrow doors, hallways and elevators, making it difficult for those who prefer an ambiance of elegant sophistication to own them. With our easy, ready to assemble packaging, the Emma can dress up any home. Simply assemble in place in 30 minutes or less, with only a screwdriver. The result is a sturdy and stylish living room. The Emma features coil spring seat cushions for firm support, with plushly rolled arm and back rests. It easily seats 3 people, and has a weight capacity of 700 pounds. Emma is available in a rich Sapphire Blue Velvet, Slate Gray Velvet and Black Velvet, all highlighted by silver nailhead trim on the arms. Turned wood feet complete the look Matching loveseat is also available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HiU09IZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Classic Furniture","source_asin":"B09GNK5M4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GNK5M4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GNK5M4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
