window.products.push({"id":367190,"name":"Tea Kettle - Premium Large Stainless Steel Teapot with Removable Infuser,1L or 1.5L (Capacity : 1L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O5il8YOKL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Reliable craft--This beautifully constructed stainless steel teapot features a polished mirror finish to bring a modern style to your home. The spout is welded precisely and polished many times, needn't worry about leaking.Practical--This is an all-in-one pot, infuser included, large capacity, 1L and 1.5L for choice. There is an outlet of vapor on the lid, which can avoid pop-up when the inside pressure is high.Durable--Made of stainless steel, heat resistence. You don't have to worry about unexpected problems result from plastic aging and glass cracking.Healthy--There's no unpleasant smell in the heating process. It would not change the taste of your tea while it brews.Multifunction--Tea, coffee, herb are applicable.Specifications:Capacity: 1L / 1.5L(optional)Materiel: Quality stainless steelSuitable for: Home, hotel, cafe, bar, restaurant.Quantity: 1Weight: 260g(1L); 270g(1.5L)Stainless steel tableware maintenance:1, After a few times of use, there might be some smirch on the surface. Please clean it with soft cloth and cleanser.2, Please do not scratch the surface when cleaning. Do not use cleanser that has abradant or bleaching compositions. Please do not use steel wool or other grinding tools.3, Please do not use knife or other sharp tools to scrape it. If there are tea or coffee sticking on it, macerate with water and clean with wood or bamboo chip.4, Never use baking soda as cleanser to wash it.5, Please do not immerse it in water for a long time. Clean it and dry it timely.Package List:1 x Kettle(other items are not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O5il8YOKL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jadeshay","source_asin":"B07KHRFP77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KHRFP77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KHRFP77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
