window.products.push({"id":367638,"name":"LifeSupplyUSA HEPA Filter Replacement Compatible with Idylis IAP-10-050, IAP-10-125, AC-2125, AC-2126 Air Purifiers, IAF-H-100B (0412558)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.64,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qvd33ztvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT VALUE: : This is a replacement HEPA air purifier filter. Each filter helps effectively filter airborne particles such as smoke, dust, pet dander and fabric fibers. Approximate dimensions are 8.5 x 7.5 x 2 inches. COMPATIBILITY: Compatible with Idylis air purifiers IAP-10-125 and IAP-10-150, compare to Part # IAF-H-100B, IAFH100B. Please note that this is a replacement product, not an OEM product. GREAT AIR QUALITY: \"High-Efficiency Particulate Air\" (HEPA) design will filter very fine airborne elements. USED BY PROFESSIONALS: LifeSupplyUSA Air Purifier Filters are made to be durable & efficient for months. Ensure the maximum airflow supply volume & protect your device. SIMPLE TO INSTALL: Installation is easy; no tools required. Simply remove and replace from your air purifier unit when needed. For maximum efficiency, it is recommended to replace filter every 6-12 months (dependent on air quality and use).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qvd33ztvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifeSupplyUSA","source_asin":"B00RD4OO9E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RD4OO9E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RD4OO9E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":367639,"name":"JAZIPO Easter Pillow Covers 22x22 Set of 4, Happy Easter Cushion Pillow Cases Bunny Easter Eggs Basket Decorative Throw Pillows Covers for Home Easter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x2mKZrdFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Features & advantages: Simple and generous pattern design: 4 kinds of patterns, exquisite printing patterns, bright colors, cute designs, suitable for Easter, etc. Add festive and bright colors to your home decoration.Zipper: Hight quality hidden zipper at the bottom, convenient to use, easy to cram pillow insert or filler.Functions: Pillow cover is easy to use and flexible. It is very suitable for couch, bed, sofa, chair, car, etc. It can create a good holiday atmosphere for your living room, bedroom, office and so on.Material: Excellent breathable linen fabric, 100% polyester. How to Create a Plump Pillow? Step 1. Fold the pillow core in half.Step 2. Fill into the pillow case, you should put the left part of the pillow slowly to reduce the risk of zipper split.Step 3. You can tide up the corner of the pillow, finally, zip up. Use and Clean: Recommended indoor use. Machine washable or hand washable, wash it with warm water, do not dry clean, do not iron, tumble dry with medium heat, do not bleach. Warm note: Just pillow cover for you, before placing an order, please check the size of your pillows. Please allow 1~2cm deviation because of hand-cutting and sewing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x2mKZrdFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JAZIPO","source_asin":"B08R3S54J1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R3S54J1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R3S54J1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":367640,"name":"Duralex - Lys Parisian Bowl 13 cm (5 inch) Set Of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31a1C5W1SsL._AC_.jpg","description":"When you're serving up your favorite dishes, whether they be soups, pastas, or hearty stews, you need the right bowl for the job. To elevate every home dining experience, you need the Set of 6 Lys 18oz Parisian Bowls from Duralex! Made to exacting specifications, these six bowls are made of incredibly sturdy glass in France. The design of the bowls is inspired by the style of Paris- delicate and elegant, featuring beautiful scalloped edges and a slightly raised base! But with that gorgeous, high-class design comes a high amount of dependability. Duralex was founded in France in 1945 and has been world-renowned for their exquisite dinnerware, and their tempered glassware and other tabletop products are made in La Chapelle-Saint-Mesmin to incredibly high standards. This glass is 2.5 times stronger than regular glass, making it incredibly scratch, impact and chip-resistant, ensuring that you have a long-lasting piece of dinnerware. These glass pieces are even designed in such a way that, if they do break, they break into smaller, safer pieces less likely to cause cuts. The bowls are even microwave and freezer safe, making keeping and reheating leftovers easy. The glass the bowls are made of is so sturdy, they can go from -4° to 212°F without cracking. The bowls are also dishwasher safe, making cleanup after dinner simple! It is recommended to wash the bowls before your first use by soaking in soapy water, and avoid metallic sponges. You deserve the finest in dinnerware! Order your very own Set of 6 Duralex Lys 18oz Parisian Bowls today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31a1C5W1SsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duralex","source_asin":"B00LCAB4I4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LCAB4I4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LCAB4I4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":367641,"name":"Yifely Rural Floal Vinyl Furniture Paper Pre-Pasted Shelf Liner Dresser Drawer Sticker 17.7 Inch by 9.8 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YwXMMZIDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features:1.Size: 17.7 inch(45cm) wide x 118 inch(3 meter) long, 0.1mm thick(Due to hand-made cutting, please leave a deviation of 3-6 cm.)2.Material: PVC paper . Paper Substrate:PVC resin. 3.Printing Technology: Water-based ink printing. Surface Workmanship: Textured.4.Function: Self-adhesive, waterproof, removable. Protect furnitures surface and inner，upgrade wall's looking. 5.Application: Dry and flat surface.6.Package Inclued: 1 X Shelf Liner RollATTENTION:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface.4. Storage methods: stored at cool, dry and ventilated place. Because of PVC material, you can put it in a ventilated place to remove the vinyl smell. 5. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLL with the toal length you ordered together in one parcel. But our other warehouse in local will send seperated roll.Installation:1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature.2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water.3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter.4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YwXMMZIDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yifely","source_asin":"B01KTKKDMA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KTKKDMA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KTKKDMA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
