window.products.push({"id":367745,"name":"Melissa & Doug Solid Wood Table and 2 Chairs Set - Light Finish Furniture for Playroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":122.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tLvvE+3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Pull one of the two durable chairs up to the child-size table--they're sized just right for kids, but strong enough to hold grown-ups, too, This sturdy wood table-and-chairs set comes in natural, white, or espresso finish to fit with any home dcor, and wipes clean to stay looking crisp and clean. The three wooden pieces are simple to construct with just a Phillips-head screwdriver, and incredibly sturdy once assembled. Top the table with a child's favorite puzzles or use it for arts and crafts, tea parties, puzzle play, lunch and snacks, and so much more. Two chairs have an 11-in seat height. Assemble with a Phillips-head screwdriver, not included. Chairs maximum load 100 lbs. Brand Story By Melissa & Doug From the Manufacturer From classic wooden toys to crafts, pretend play, and games, Melissa & Doug products provide a launch pad to ignite imagination and a sense of wonder in all children so they can discover themselves, their passions, and their purpose.  Since the company’s founding more than 25 years ago, Melissa & Doug has consistently delivered innovative products that inspire open-ended thinking, encourage kids to see new possibilities, and offer Countless Ways to Play. It’s part of a bigger vision to Take Back Childhood. Because by giving children a true childhood with the space and freedom to explore their world, we give them a path to realizing their full potential! See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tLvvE+3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melissa & Doug","source_asin":"B083ZBD248","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083ZBD248","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083ZBD248","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":367746,"name":"ORIGLE Air Fryer Liners 100Pcs Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 6.3Inch Non-stick Parchment Paper, Oil Resistant, Waterproof, Food Grade Oven Liner f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hxEOG5VWL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"KEEP YOUR AIR FRYER CLEAN - Do you love baking but hate cleaning up? ORIGLE air fryer liner Makes cleanup easier than ever. Before using the air fryer, simply place the airfryer liners inside and then add the food. When you're done cooking, simply take the air fryer paper liners out to effectively keep food residue away from the fryer, leaving it as clean as if it had never been used, saving time and effort. These paper liners are must have if you hate cleaning after baking. HEALTHY AND BIODEGRADABLE MATERIAL - The air fryer liners disposable is made of food-grade natural wood pulp. Waterproof, oil-proof, non-stick, 100% healthy and heat resistant, can withstand temperatures up to 450°F(230°C). Because the material is environmentally friendly and biodegradable, it can be used for composting after use, so you don't have to worry about pollution at all. NO INTERFERENCE WITH AIR CIRCULATION IN THE AIR FRYER - Heat is generated by air circulation through the walls of the pan. Using air fryer parchment paper does not affect air circulation and has no effect on the taste of the food itself. EASY TO USE - These non-stick parchment paper for air fryer are designed with a round bowl shape, liners for air fryer basket do not need to tear, fold, cut, nor bend, and you can directly put greaseproof paper circles in when you are ready to cook. Greaseproof paper sheets is heightened edge 4.5cm can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. WIDELY USED - Disposable air fryer paper liners suitable for air fryer, microwave, oven, steamer, cooker, etc. The airfryer liner can be applied for baking, roasting, frying, or serving food, suitable for home baking, camping, BBQ, summer party, and so on, lightweight and practical. ⚠ 【WARM TIP】: Do not add air fryer liners while the air fryer is in preheat mode. When using air fryer liners, put as much food as possible so that the hot air from preheating does not blow the air fryer liners up. Be sure to avoid air fryer paper touching the heating tube, or you will have what is called a burned paper situation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hxEOG5VWL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIGLE","source_asin":"B0BCKW35WN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCKW35WN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCKW35WN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
