window.products.push({"id":367820,"name":"Fuloon Tassel Tablecloth - Cotton Linen Dust-Proof Rectangle Oblong Table Cover for Kitchen Dining Room Party Home Tabletop Decoration (Gray, 55 x 87 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lHrMuHiIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅MASTERFUL DESIGN:Fuloon cotton linen tablecloths with delicate embroidery patterns and beautiful fringed edges.Add a touch of elegance to your room while protecting and decorating your table, making your meal more enjoyable ✅WRINKLE & DUST PROOF: Fuloon rectangle tablecloth made of super hard wearing 100% heavy cotton linen fabric,which are more wrinkle-proof and shrink-proof than other materials.with a seamless construction that won't easily fray after long term use.And our tablecloth also use new technology and high-quality dyes, good fixing effect, not easy to fade. ✅RECOMMEND SIZE:Tablecloth measures 55\" Width x 86\" Length (140 x 220 cm,6-8 seats), 55\" Width x 102\" Length (140 x 260 cm,8-10 seats),55\" Width x 120\" Length (140 x 300 cm,10-12 seats),includes tassel length, size deviation is between 1 to 2 inch. ✅WIDELY USAGE:Instantly brighten dining tables while protecting surfaces.This versatile tablecloth is reminiscent of casual dining and perfect for everyday meals with the family, parties, birthdays, baby shower or special holiday gatherings ✅EASY TO CARE:Machine washable in low temperature or cold water, gentle cycle,Hand wash best,No bleaching,Tumble dry on low heat or lay flat to dry,Fuloon cotton linen tablecloths can be lightly ironed if necessary","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lHrMuHiIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fuloon","source_asin":"B08G1RBY41","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G1RBY41","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G1RBY41","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":367821,"name":"Yifely Light Brown Wood Grain Shelving Paper Self Adhesive Shelf Liner PVC Dresser Drawer Cabinet Sticker 17.7 Inch by 9.8 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ja1h-r8HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Instruction For Use: 1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature. 2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water. 3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter. 4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth. 5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.  This multi-purpose shelf paper can protect the furniture from humidity and dirt efficiently.A adorable furniture accessories for your daily home life.Wide:45cmLength: 3MPlease allow 3~7cm deviation as they are manual cutting. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLL together in one parcel. Material: PVCPackage Included: One RollNote:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface. Hope you can understand","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ja1h-r8HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yifely","source_asin":"B01I2VMUUQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I2VMUUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I2VMUUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
