window.products.push({"id":367857,"name":"Joy Pebble Portable Air Conditioner, 10000 BTU for Room up to 450 sq. ft, Dehumidifier & Fan, Portable AC with ECO Mode, 2 Fan Speeds, 24H Timer, Remo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":339.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BtJ66NOrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Easy to Install & Move】Move Joy Pebble Portable AC to the preferred cooling area, attach the hose and adjustable window brackets.Turn the unit on and let your cooling begin! No extra tools are needed, Joy Pebble AC portable can be set up easily within minutes, and can be done by anyone.Easy to move the free-standing air conditioner from room-to-room with caster wheels, making them an ideal solution for renters or homeowners who don't want to install a traditional AC. 【Powerful&Flexible Cooling】Features a compact and multi-functional design, Joy Pebble 10000BTU portable air conditioner cools a room of up to 450sq.ft,and offers flexible cooling options, allowing you to adjust the temperature (62°F~86°F)and fan speed (2 fan speeds) to suit your comfort level.※The 6000BTU marked on the nameplate is the SACC standard. Under the Ashrae standard, the actual BTU of this product is 10000BTU. 【3-IN-1 FUNCTIONALITY】Joy Pebble portable AC air conditioner includes 3 modes to choose from-Cool, Dry and Fan. With 63Pint/day dehumidifying capacity and self-evaporating operation, this air conditioner provides steady, effective cooling for rooms up to 450 sq.Air flow is rated at 280 m³/h. ft. And features an easy-to-operate digital display/compact remote control to provide you a comfortable environment.It’s the ideal compact air conditioner for apartments, bedrooms,offices, or living rooms. 【Energy Efficiency&Low Maintenance】:Joy Pebble portable air conditioner with ECO mode can lead to significant cost savings over time.Joy Pebble air conditioner free standing require minimal maintenance, making them a hassle-free option for homeowners. With washable air filters that can be easily cleaned, and also feature automatic shut-off functions to prevent overheating or damage to the unit. 【Satisfactory Service】As your satisfaction is of the utmost importance to us, Joy Pebble is committed to providing you with premium products and thoughtful service. 1-YEARS MANUFACTURER'S WARRANTY -- Shop with confidence. Any question about Joy Pebble air conditioner, please contact with customer Service directly, we will reply to your email within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BtJ66NOrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joy Pebble","source_asin":"B0C6M8V2Z8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6M8V2Z8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6M8V2Z8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
