window.products.push({"id":367895,"name":"Whaline 193pcs Graduation Window Sticker Clings Removable Grad Window Decorations Cap Diploma Window Decals Grad Congratulations Party Decor Supplies ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81049V4RqOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Electrostatic Stickers - 8 different styles, each measuring 10.8 x13.8 inch(27 x 35cm), including 193 graduation element patterns of different sizes, different sizes and patterns to meet your different scene needs. Quality PVC Material - you can spray some water on the window before use so that the window sticker can be more firmly attached to the window, easy to peel off, and can be reused, without leaving any traces when torn off. Double-sided Pattern - you can clearly see the pattern from the front and back of the glass. Abundant graduation season element designs (congratulations, grad, stars, graduation caps, glasses, medals, etc.), you can freely combine to make your graduation season decoration look richer and more wonderful, to create a graduation atmosphere. Wide Application - You can place them on any object with a smooth surface, such as wooden furniture, floors, tiles, mirrors, and even tables. It is perfect school, home, office, and party supplies during the graduation season. It perfectly match with other hanging decorations, banners, garlands and wreaths. Delicate Graduation Gift - Super warm and impressive gift for your family, friends and loved ones, make them enjoy the pleasure of DIY home decoration to get the draduation party more interesting and memorable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81049V4RqOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whaline","source_asin":"B0BXL6NFMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXL6NFMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXL6NFMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
