window.products.push({"id":367906,"name":"Hortsun 100 Pieces LED Fairy Lights Battery Operated Waterproof Copper Wire LED String Lights 7ft 20 LED Starry Lights for Wedding Birthday Party Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hl7sD9PzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:  Convenient to use: The LED fairy string lights are low power and insulates heat, remain safe to the touch, can still keep cool and won't overheat after long time using. The bendable flexible light string allows you to easily make any shape or wrapped it on anything you want like wreaths, trees, plant, flowers, weddings decor.  DIY decoration: These LED battery operated string light copper wire can be bent into any shape you want, very suitable for bedroom, wedding, party, indoor, outdoor, mason jar, table centerpiece, handicraft projects, and DIY, ideal for indoor or outdoor lighting decorations.  Specifications: Main material: silver synthetic filaments and LED lights Size: 7 ft in length with 20 LED lights Color: multicolor  Package includes: 100 x LED lights strings  Warm notes: Manual measurement, please allow slight errors on size. The color might exist slight difference due to different displays. There may be a risk of entanglement, please keep them away from children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hl7sD9PzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hortsun","source_asin":"B09RGYB48Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RGYB48Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RGYB48Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":367907,"name":"Pluto Produkter Snowflake Rotary Candleholder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wgf9PUB3L._AC_SL1049_.jpg","description":"When the included tea light candle is lit in the base of the rotary candle holder, the heat of the candle will make the snowflakes and the carousel spin, and shaped reflections move around the ceiling. Comes nicely presented in a box ideal as a gift. Remarkably sophisticated with just a touch of whimsy, this snowflake candle holder is a wonderful way to bring smiles with a unique display of entertainment in motion! Each of our stunning rotary candle holders is crafted from durable metal with a beautiful silver finish. Just position the flickering tea light candle (included), and within moments the heat from the flame will set the art in motion. You can add your own scented tea light and indulge in your favorite aroma. These Änglaspel are designed in and imported from Sweden. They are contemporary versions of the traditional candle chimes. Because these were designed to actually rotate and cast beautiful shadows, the metal is thin, and the item light-weight. Some of the competing rotary candleholders you will see have less detail (especially in shadow), and 4 clappers rather than 6. When you see the Pluto Produkter AB as the manufacturer and PlutoGifts as the merchant, you can be confident of high quality and wonderful attention to detail. In order to see the hundred different choices from Pluto Produkter AB just type \"rotary candleholder\" in the search box above. For those of us who grew up with them, rotary candleholders are a seasonal blend of light and motion. They belong to a purely domestic and old-fashioned type of joy, one that emphasizes a dark room over a brightly lit one (to appreciate the dancing interplay of light and shadow); and calm over activity (so that stray air currents shouldn’t disrupt the workings). Darkness, stillness, silence: all inescapable aspects of the northern winter, and it is therefore not surprising that candleholders should be such an enduring tradition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wgf9PUB3L._AC_SL1049_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pluto Produkter","source_asin":"B002QVZZOC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-367907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002QVZZOC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002QVZZOC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
